      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "兵隊　三小隊（へいたい さんしょうたい）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Troops: three platoons. This is the last column of Annaka Domain's return; in fascicles 8 and 9 the military prints after the officials and, as here, can run past the next domain's marker. The return gives no strength per platoon for Annaka."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "安中藩兵隊"
      }
