      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "○麻田藩（あさだはん）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Maru-marker opening the entry for Asada Domain, a small Settsu holding of the Aoki house. The circle plus domain name plus 藩 marks the start of the domain's block: everything printed to its right was read earlier and belongs to Annaka, everything to its left belongs to Asada."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "麻田藩マル標"
      }
    ],
