        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "知事"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "知事（ちじ）＝知藩事"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Governor (chihanji), the office heading that opens Asada's roster. The name register below this column is blank, so the return supplies no name against the office. The same thing happens in Annaka's roster on the facing leaf, so a blank here is a feature of the form rather than a gap in the scan."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "麻田藩知事"
      }
    ],
