  {
    "id": "anno-asada_lower_p225_right-09",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "「權少參事　戸田鐵彌　巳十二月屆」"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "「権少参事　戸田鉄弥　巳十二月届」（ごんしょうさんじ とだ てつや・みどし じゅうにがつ とどけ）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Bracketed insert in the upper register, three small runs read right to left: office, name, and the return that reports it. It records that in the return of the 12th month of the snake year (Meiji 2/12, early 1870) Toda Tetsuya holds the post of acting junior councillor, whereas the main table lists him among the junior councillors. The square brackets mark it as an amendment carried into the compiled table rather than part of the original return."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "權少參事戸田鐵彌屆書"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/lower_p225_right.jpg",
