  {
    "id": "anno-asada_lower_p225_right-10",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "一小隊六十人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "一小隊六十人（いっしょうたい ろくじゅうにん）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Troops: one platoon, sixty men. This is the leftmost and therefore last column of Asada Domain's entry, and it is the only per-platoon strength printed on the leaf. The final glyph is 人, not 八: its two strokes merge at the apex for the first twenty-four pixels, whereas the 八 in the name Aoki Kuhachirō lower on the page shows two separated stroke groups from its first inked row."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "麻田藩兵隊一小隊"
      }
    ],
